message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "biocypher-workspace-eval: testing and model evaluation of the BioCypher agentic workspace"
abstract: >-
  Harness to quantitatively compare language models in the BioCypher agentic
  workspace: a task ladder for building a BioCypher adapter for a synthetic
  protein interaction dataset, automatic grading against a ground truth, and
  per-run process metrics.
